{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>[Wishlist] now for an Exclusive Discount on Launch!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/18530ce34a2713c8f80bda6f5ce16440.poster.avif?t=1768233360\" width=604 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/18530ce34a2713c8f80bda6f5ce16440.webm?t=1768233360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/18530ce34a2713c8f80bda6f5ce16440.mp4?t=1768233360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/ec1f8c4914bf8db467ec9d37e764a8e6.poster.avif?t=1768233360\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/ec1f8c4914bf8db467ec9d37e764a8e6.webm?t=1768233360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/ec1f8c4914bf8db467ec9d37e764a8e6.mp4?t=1768233360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/114183b2e166f5b527fd038ecf45e2ef.avif?t=1768233360\" width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower of Wizard</strong> is a fast-paced survival rogue-lite where you ascend a cursed tower brimming with monstrous foes and fallen wizards.<br>Unleash devastating spells, chain together powerful relics, and craft absurdly broken builds to survive relentless waves and colossal bosses. Can you ascend to the top of the tower?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/2e5020786d3eacec816b21d168a745e0.avif?t=1768233360\" width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/ee0867136fc33a249fe2d229845fea64.poster.avif?t=1768233360\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/ee0867136fc33a249fe2d229845fea64.webm?t=1768233360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/ee0867136fc33a249fe2d229845fea64.mp4?t=1768233360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is a chance to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up mid-fight and choose from game-changing upgrades. Build a loadout that fits your style, or go for the most absurd, overpowered combinations you can imagine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/3c7346476a069db37cc354b225140f4c.avif?t=1768233360\" width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/c21c6939fdb1fea04ec7784c6613de12.poster.avif?t=1768233360\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/c21c6939fdb1fea04ec7784c6613de12.webm?t=1768233360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/c21c6939fdb1fea04ec7784c6613de12.mp4?t=1768233360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure awaits\u2026 but the strongest power always comes with a price.<br>Open chests to uncover rare relics that can turn you into an unstoppable force \u2014 or burden you with dangerous curses. Each choice shapes your run, making every floor a gamble between risk and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/b73d6778d34b55d166ed15e1cb8d2644.avif?t=1768233360\" width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/17406fe9bd2adbf309638c813e8ee972.poster.avif?t=1768233360\" width=780 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/17406fe9bd2adbf309638c813e8ee972.webm?t=1768233360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930570/extras/17406fe9bd2adbf309638c813e8ee972.mp4?t=1768233360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Arsenal of Magic: Explore over 40+ magical spells to unlock and use throughout your quest in the tower.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful Builds: Choose from a variety of upgrades with different rarities (common, uncommon, rare, epic, <strong>legendary</strong>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense wave-based combat and challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying pixel art and spell effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragrap